:: Widgets Bus [widget]

<<widget "buswait">><<nobr>>
	<<add_link "<<busicon>><<link [[Wait for a bus (0:02)|Bus]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>">><<hideDisplay>>
<</nobr>><</widget>>

:: Widget Passout Bus [widget]

<<widget "passoutbus">><<nobr>>
	[[Everything fades to black...->Passout bus]]
<</nobr>><</widget>>

:: Widgets Destination [widget]

<<widget "travelsafe">><<nobr>>
	<<if $worn.lower.skirt is 1 and $exhibitionism gte 55>>
		A wicked thought occurs to you. If you were to move a little closer to the center of the bus and shift your skirt a little, anyone who walked by you would see right up your skirt.
		<<if $exhibitionism gte 75 and $worn.under_lower.exposed>>
			The thought of flashing your <<undies>> on the bus turns you on. <<arousal 500>><<garousal>>
			<br><br>
			<<link [[do it|Bus flashing]]>><</link>><<exhibitionist4>>
			<br>
			<<link [[dont|Bus arrive]]>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<elseif !$worn.under_lower.exposed>>
			The thought of flashing your <<undies>> on the bus turns you on. <<arousal 300>><<garousal>>
			<br><br>
			<<link [[do it|Bus flashing]]>><</link>><<exhibitionist3>>
			<br>
			<<link [[dont|Bus arrive]]>><</link>>
			<br>

		<<else>>
			Alas, you are way too prudish to act upon such wild desires in your current state.
			<br>
			<br>
			<<busarrive>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<busarrive>>
	<</if>>
<</nobr>><</widget>>

<<widget "busarrive">><<nobr>>
	Your bus arrives at your destination.
	<br><br>
	<<destination5>>
<</nobr>><</widget>>

